{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2984380/extras/English.png?t=1742576759\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u300aTurmoil Uprising: Dynasty\u300bis a rogue-lite casual game, player needs to make decisions to grow your character, overcome challenges from mobs and bosses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Game now features 15 heroes, each has unique perks and characteristics. Players can make their choices to enhance the hero base on strengths and weaknesses of the hero, to defeat powerful foes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2984380/extras/Zhou_Yu.jpg?t=1742576759\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use gold earned from play throughs to buy permamnent upgrades to gain advantage for your next run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2984380/extras/upgd.png?t=1742576759\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Utilize every power-up, overcome enemies as you survive through waves of attacks!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Create your own strategy, climb up the legendary leaderboard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Will you be able to rise above the turmoil?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2984380/extras/daqiao1.png?t=1742576759\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2984380?t=1742576759","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2984380/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1742576759","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2984380/e65d7b9e4041a3ab00926368f3a73b0a34454a2a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1742576759","caps